none" href="#"><span class="text-xs min-[360px]:text-sm min-[400px]:text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-blue-dark leading-none">Vishv Book</span><span class="text-[9px] min-[360px]:text-[10px] min-[400px]:text-xs sm:text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-amber-600 mt-0.5 sm:mt-1 leading-none">Publication</span></a></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 shrink-0"><div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 py-1.5 px-3 rounded-full"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Intake Desk Online</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] sm:text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 py-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-xs whitespace-nowrap"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span><span>Verified Platform</span></div></div></div></header><main class="grow"><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue-dark via-[#0C2340] to-brand-blue-deep text-white py-16 sm:py-24"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-15 bg-[radial-gradient(#3B82F6_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]"></div><div class="absolute top-10 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 w-64 h-64 bg-red-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start space-y-6 animate-fade-in-up"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-950/80 border border-amber-400/40 py-1.5 px-4 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-900/60 transition-colors shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-amber-300 uppercase">A STRUCTURED PATH TO ONLINE WORK</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight font-display text-wrap-balance">Work from home with <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-300 via-yellow-200 to-amber-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent font-black">verified remote projects</span>.</h1><p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">Connect directly with certified book publishers, complete scheduled manuscript typing and transcription tasks, and earn secure monthly bank payouts. Vishv Book Publication handles standard quality guidelines, contract security, and transparent direct communication with zero middle-agent interference.</p><div class="w-full pt-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4">
